{"unit_id":"BBbangage__dsh-prompt-enhance#card-zh","repo":"BBbangage/dsh-prompt-enhance","commit":"8e4abd2b4641e6cbfc05aacf7e8518158ff87744","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhance 是一款面向 DSH Web 聊天界面的提示词增强插件。在输入框旁提供增强按钮，也注册 /prompt-enhance 命令；它优先调用 DSH 当前选定模型改写任务，模型不可用或超时则使用内置规则模板。增强结果保留原始需求，并按任务类型补充可执行步骤；界面按钮支持一键恢复增强前的草稿。适合希望把简短任务整理成具体要求、同时保留原文以便复核的 DSH Web 用户。使用时需要 DSH Web 的会话输入界面和命令远程调用能力，不需要为插件另配 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:40-88","lib/index.js:91-129","lib/index.js:132-155","lib/client.js:62-107"]}
{"unit_id":"BBbangage__dsh-prompt-enhance#card-en","repo":"BBbangage/dsh-prompt-enhance","commit":"8e4abd2b4641e6cbfc05aacf7e8518158ff87744","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-enhance adds a prompt button and /prompt-enhance command to DSH Web. It expands tasks with the selected model, or uses built-in templates if that fails or times out. The result keeps the original request, and the button restores the previous draft. It needs no separate plugin API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:40-88","lib/index.js:91-129","lib/index.js:132-155","lib/client.js:62-107"]}
